#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:412
msgid "Time bar"
msgstr "Vremenska traka"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:413
msgid ""
"Press this button to configure the time bar font. The time bar is the widget "
"that shows the hours in the agenda view. This button will open the \"Select "
"Font\" dialog, allowing you to choose the hour font for the time bar."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ovo dugme za podešavanje fonta vremenske trake. Vremenska traka "
"je dodatak koji pokazuje sate u pregledu  dnevnog reda. Ovo dugme će "
"otvoriti \"Odaberi Font\" dijalog, omogućujući vam da odaberete font sata za "
"vriemensku traku."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:417
msgid "Month view"
msgstr "Pregled mjeseci"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:418
msgid ""
"Press this button to configure the month view font. This button will open "
"the \"Select Font\" dialog, allowing you to choose the font for the items in "
"the month view."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ovo dugme za konfigurisanje fonta mjesečnog prikaza. Ovo dugme će "
"otvoriti \"Odaberi Font\" dijalog, omogućujući vam da odaberete font za "
"stavke u mjesečnom prikazu."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:422
msgid "Agenda view"
msgstr "Pregled podsjetnika"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:423
msgid ""
"Press this button to configure the agenda view font. This button will open "
"the \"Select Font\" dialog, allowing you to choose the font for the events "
"in the agenda view."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ovo dugme za konfigurisanje mjesečnog prikaza fonta. Ovo dugme će "
"otvoriti \"Odaberi Font\" dijalog, omogućujući vam da odaberete font za "
"stavke u mjesečnom prikazu."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:427
msgid "Current-time line"
msgstr "Linija trenutnog vremena"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Fonts)
#: eventviews.kcfg:428
msgid ""
"Press this button to configure the current-time line font. This button will "
"open the \"Select Font\" dialog, allowing you to choose the font for the "
"current-time line in the agenda view."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite ovo dugme za podešavanje fonta linije trenutnog vremena. Ovo "
"dugme će otvoriti \"Odaberi Font\" dijalog, omogućujući vam da odaberete "
"font za tekuću vremensku liniju kod pregleda podsjetnika."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultTodoAttachMethod), group (Hidden Options)
#: eventviews.kcfg:452
msgid "Default todo attachment method"
msgstr "Uobičajna metoda za prilog."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DefaultTodoAttachMethod), group (Hidden Options)
#: eventviews.kcfg:453
msgid "The default way of attaching dropped emails to a task"
msgstr "Uobičajni način na koji se ispuštene e-mail poruke prilžu zadatku"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Theming)
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Theme/Month view)
#: eventviews.kcfg:510 eventviews.kcfg:610
msgid "Highlight color"
msgstr "Boja označenog"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Theming)
#: eventviews.kcfg:511
msgid ""
"Select the highlight color here. The highlight color will be used for "
"marking the currently selected area in your agenda and in the date navigator."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite boju označenja ovdje. Boja za označenje će se koristiti za "
"označavanje trenutno odabranog područja u dnevniku i na navigatoru datuma."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Theming)
#: eventviews.kcfg:516
msgid "Select the working hours background color for the agenda view here."
msgstr "Odaberite pozadinsku boju radnih sata za dnevni red ovdje."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Theme/Month view)
#: eventviews.kcfg:603
msgid "Month view background color"
msgstr "Pozadinska boja mjesečnog prikaza"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Theme/Month view)
#: eventviews.kcfg:604
msgid "Select the Month view background color here."
msgstr "Odaberite ovdje pozadinsku boju prikaza mjeseca"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Theme/Month view)
#: eventviews.kcfg:611
msgid ""
"Select the highlight color here. The highlight color will be used for "
"marking the currently selected area in your Month and in the date navigator."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite boju isticanja ovdje. Boja za isticanje će se koristiti za "
"označavanje trenutno odabranog područja u vašem mjesecu i u navigatoru "
"datuma."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Theme/Month view)
#: eventviews.kcfg:616
msgid "Select the working hours background color for the Month view here."
msgstr "Odaberite boju za prikaz radnih sati za pregled mjeseca ovdje."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Theme/Month view)
#: eventviews.kcfg:638
msgid "Default event color"
msgstr "Uobičajna boja događaja"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Theme/Month view)
#: eventviews.kcfg:639
msgid ""
"Select the default event color here. The default event color will be used "
"for events categories in your Month. Note that you can specify a separate "
"color for each event category below."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite boju zadanih događaja ovdje. Boja zadani događaj će se koristiti "
"za kategoriju događaja u mjesecu. Imajte na umu da možete odrediti posebnu "
"boju za svaku kategoriju događaja ispod."

